{"id":"n60505-3-7","stage":5,"title":"빤히 · 目不转睛地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60505-3-7-1","ko":"누구를 그렇게 빤히 바라보고 있는 거야?","zh":"你在那么目不转睛地盯着谁看啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누구를","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구를","audio":"/audio/42cb73a219b037f71978.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"빤히","meaning":"目不转睛地，一眨不眨地","explanation":"빤히：目不转睛地，一眨不眨地。","readings":[{"term":"빤히","audio":"/audio/cd0759d9b71b3895dbbf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60505","senseId":"3","lemma":"빤히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빤히","audio":"/audio/cd0759d9b71b3895dbbf.mp3"}},{"text":"바라보고","meaning":"望，看","explanation":"바라보다：望，看；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"바라보다","audio":"/audio/c09f5b5d3ee043cc11f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64743","senseId":"1","lemma":"바라보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바라보고","audio":"/audio/58e3c05f9ab4b2071657.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"cd0759d9b71b3895","term":"빤히","zh":"目不转睛地，一眨不眨地","audio":"/audio/cd0759d9b71b3895dbbf.mp3","entryId":"60505","definition":"在正面清楚注视地。","pronunciation":["빤ː히"]},{"id":"c09f5b5d3ee043cc","term":"바라보다","zh":"望，看","audio":"/audio/c09f5b5d3ee043cc11f8.mp3","entryId":"64743","definition":"正对着看。","pronunciation":["바라보다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/2034aa0977f62b426188.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60505-3-7-2","ko":"저기 건너편에 앉아 있는 사람이 나를 보고 자꾸 웃잖아.","zh":"那边坐着的那个人一直看着我，还一直笑呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"건너편에","meaning":"对面","explanation":"건너편：对面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"건너편","audio":"/audio/2f7f96cd9c7f8ad9615d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46806","senseId":"1","lemma":"건너편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건너편에","audio":"/audio/d582